    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Nu ðancige ic Gode ælmihtigum his fultumes ⁊ his mildheortnesse, þæt ic þa myclan hearmas þe us to fundedon swa geloged hæbbe, þæt we ne þurfon þanon nenes hearmes us asittan, ac us to fullan fultume ⁊ to ahreddingge, gyf us neod byð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Now I thank God Almighty for his help and his mercy, that I have disposed of the great dangers which threatened us, with the result that we need not expect any danger from that quarter, but rather [that they will grant] us abundant help and deliverance, if we need it.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
